        "text": "Learning about the cloud options for Python\napplications\nCloud computing is the ultimate frontier for programmers these days. In this section,\nwe will investigate how we can develop Python applications using a cloud development\nenvironment or using a specific Software Development Kit ( SDK ) for cloud deployment,\nand then how we can execute the Python code in a cloud environment. We will also\ninvestigate options regarding data-intensive processing, such as Apache Spark on the\ncloud. We will start with the cloud-based development environments.\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 Introducing Python development environments for the cloud\n\u2022 Introducing cloud runtime options for Python\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
